{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d25b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a07d34-fcf0-7332-85e2-0e8a0d37c76e"},"sequence":1928,"recorded_at":1780531400003851,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"7741b655-4956-456e-8ab0-1e5b6c597882","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"7741b655-4956-456e-8ab0-1e5b6c597882","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"7741b655-4956-456e-8ab0-1e5b6c597882"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Round 4 resumed and handed off to review (`to-review`, checklist 26/26).\n\nWhat was wrong and what I changed:\n\n- **The two red tests were a production regression, not tests-ahead-of-production.** The round-4 edit had rewritten the load digest arm as `digest != indexed && field != SelfEventID` ([chain.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3tq4ns/worktree/internal/sessrepo/chain.go:293)); the field is proven two lines above, so the arm was dead. Rev3 shipped the bare digest comparison (verified in the rev3 patch); restored. Both tests pass.\n- **The census was masked, not blind.** The derived instrument (every production file via `invcore.ScanProduction`, diffed against the ledger) is sound, but TestMain skipped the whole audit unless the suite was green — so the two red tests hid every plant. The static equality audit now runs on every full unfiltered run, green or red; only the runtime refusal audit stays gated on green. Red-before on the green tree, real exit codes: P2 new-file plant → exit 1 (`plantextra.go:6`); P3 `string==` plant → exit 1 (`store.go:17`). The plant tests now couple to the live derived set and ledger instead of hard-coded copies.\n- **Numbers re-derived:** refusal census 35 (25/5/5, README's 36 fixed), equality 2=2, battery **33 applied / 33 killed / 0 survivors** (16 narrowing, 10 arm-deletion, 4 census-only, 3 audit-only; NOT_APPLIED/COMPILE_FAIL distinct). Candidate tree `7ab337c8` by detached-index `write-tree`, exactly the 11 CR paths, no scratch (also removed a stray empty `relative/` dir). N2 wording fixed (owner refuses one arm *later*).\n\nGates observed this session, all exit 0: build, vet, Windows vet+build, gofmt, `go test ./...` (24/24), `-race` in 4 groups (24 unique pkgs), tracecheck (60/98), sessrepo cover 87.6%.\n\nEvidence attached: `TASK-260830-wbpf1v_outcome-rev4.md`, `TASK-260830-wbpf1v_mutation-battery-rev4.log`. Work left uncommitted for the CR snapshot. One note: `worktree status` still prints `rev 3 ready` at this instant; the handoff accepted the new snapshot and moved the task to `to-review`, which is the publication step my role owns.","reason":null}}
